":null,"cell":"extracted-text:chars:19194-19328"}],"purpose":"① 地域人材の発掘をすすめ、それらを活用した学習機会の提供に努める。\n② 関係機関・団体と連携しながら、住民からのニーズに応じた生活に役立つ学習機会の拡充に努める。\n③ これからの地域を担う人材の育成に向け、大人としての自覚を促す事業の実施に努める。"}},{"targetId":"cached-01396-443762860532694446b7a440","targetRecordSha256":"4ef06f8df9cba4473d0c639ebf495981d2a25984b73beb01734678a07ac0de0e","sheetId":"cached-01396-fad90391873ae573fd4dd1fa","add":{"department":null,"amounts":[],"indicators":[],"ratings":[],"evidence":[{"sourceUrl":"https://www.vill.makkari.lg.jp/resources/output/contents/file/release/869/5178/R1tenkenhyouka.pdf","sourcePageUrl":"https://www.vill.makkari.lg.jp/resources/output/contents/file/release/869/5178/R1tenkenhyouka.pdf","format":"pdf","fetchedAt":"2026-10-21T08:40:28.170Z","sha256":"a2c1980b31611319fafb70fac918b22cf9989b0c2cd401b7e6dcc40e61a54645","rawText":"英語学習講師派遣事業","page":null,"sheet":null,"cell":"extracted-text:chars:15432-15442"},{"sourceUrl":"https://www.vill.makkari.lg.jp/resources/output/contents/file/release/869/5178/R1tenkenhyouka.pdf","sourcePageUrl":"https://www.vill.makkari.lg.jp/resources/output/contents/file/release/869/5178/R1tenkenhyouka.pdf","format":"pdf","fetchedAt":"2026-10-21T08:40:28.170Z","sha256":"a2c1980b31611319fafb70fac918b22cf9989b0c2cd401b7e6dcc40e61a54645","rawText":"外国人講師を派遣し、村内の各学校における\n英語指導の充実を図る","page":null,"sheet":null,"cell":"extracted-text:chars:15455-15486"}],"purpose":"外国人講師を派遣し、村内の各学校における英語指導の充実を図る"}},{"targetId":"cached-01396-4b74b935ee27729a11ffe067","targetRecordSha256":"e2c0647b2c4851be6b04932221db271513061aacc54410c4bd70b16453adb47b","sheetId":"cached-01396-f1d50e5a7c950d78e1a7fbf6","add":{"department":null,"amounts":[],"indicators":[],"ratings":[],"evidence":[{"sourceUrl":"https://www.vill.makkari.lg.jp/resources/output/contents/file/release/869/5178/R1tenkenhyouka.pdf","sourcePageUrl":"https://www.vill.makkari.lg.jp/resources/output/contents/file/release/869/5178/R1tenkenhyouka.pdf","format":"pdf","fetchedAt":"2026-10-21T08:40:28.170Z","sha256":"a2c1980b